<view class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{view.mode === 'demo'}}" class="demo">开发演示 · 问卷和协议尚待专业审定 · 不会真实扣款</view>
  <view class="eyebrow">A NEW CHAPTER</view><view class="title">为自己，开始这90天。</view><view class="subtitle">先了解服务与风险，再决定加入。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error gap">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="card hero"><view class="row"><view><view class="hero-title">90天晨练减脂营</view><view class="muted">每天约10元 · 允许每周两天免打卡</view></view><view class="amount">¥900</view></view><view class="divider"></view><view>前12周达标各返70元，最后6天返60元。</view><view>累计最多900元，无额外结营奖金。</view><view class="note" style="color:#d4e4d4">挑战15—20斤需结合个人情况，不保证人人达到。付款后按公布的周期规则执行。</view><view wx:if="{{view.camp}}" class="small-gap">拟入营：{{view.camp.title}} · {{view.camp.startDate}}</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{view.paid}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">你已经加入本期</view><button class="primary" bindtap="home">回到今日</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{view && !view.paid}}">
    <view class="card"><view class="step">第一步 · 先读清楚</view><view class="section-title">身体健康，始终放在前面</view><view>运动和饮食调整存在损伤、低血糖及心血管事件等风险，严重时可能危及生命。勾选同意不能免除经营者依法应承担的责任。</view><view class="notice gap">运动中胸痛、晕厥或明显异常气促时，立即停止并及时就医，紧急情况拨打120。</view>
      <view class="row gap"><text class="link" data-type="health" bindtap="agreement">阅读完整健康告知</text><text class="link" data-type="privacy" bindtap="agreement">健康信息处理说明</text></view>
      <checkbox-group bindchange="consents"><label class="check-label"><checkbox value="health" checked="{{healthConsent}}" color="#176b50"/><text>我已阅读健康告知，理解服务范围与风险</text></label><label class="check-label"><checkbox value="privacy" checked="{{privacyConsent}}" color="#176b50"/><text>我单独同意为报名筛查和服务处理必要健康信息</text></label><label class="check-label"><checkbox value="terms" checked="{{termsConsent}}" color="#176b50"/><text>我已阅读并同意服务及返款规则（付款前确认）</text></label></checkbox-group><text class="link" data-type="terms" bindtap="agreement">查看服务、返款及退出规则草稿</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{healthConsent && privacyConsent}}" class="card"><view class="step">第二步 · 一分钟健康筛查</view><view class="section-title">先确认是否适合本营服务</view><view class="field"><view class="label">昵称</view><input class="input" maxlength="16" value="{{nickname}}" data-field="nickname" bindinput="input" placeholder="营友看到的名字"/></view><view class="row field"><view class="grow"><view class="label">年龄（35—55岁）</view><input class="input" type="number" maxlength="2" value="{{age}}" data-field="age" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="grow"><view class="label">身高（厘米）</view><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{height}}" data-field="height" bindinput="input"/></view></view><view class="field"><view class="label">初始体重（公斤）</view><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{weight}}" data-field="weight" bindinput="input"/></view>
      <view wx:for="{{questions}}" wx:key="key" class="field"><view class="label">{{index + 1}}. {{item.label}}</view><picker range="{{options}}" value="{{item.index}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindchange="answer"><view class="picker">{{options[item.index]}}　⌄</view></picker></view><view class="note">如实填写，不确定就选“不确定”。问卷仅用于服务分流，不能证明运动绝对安全。</view><button class="secondary gap" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="screen">提交健康筛查</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{view.me.healthStatus === 'review'}}" class="card"><view class="section-title warning">需要进一步评估，暂不开放付款</view><view>请先接受专业评估。普通管理员不能代替医生判断；目前不会收取报名费。</view><view class="note">高血压并非一律不能运动，需要结合控制情况和用药等因素评估。</view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{view.me.healthStatus === 'clear'}}" class="card"><view class="step">第三步 · 确认费用与服务</view><view class="section-title">符合当前服务范围</view><view>每周5个有效日达标，2天灵活安排。末期6天完成4天可返60元；未达标只影响该周期。</view><view class="note">退出及服务未提供等退款应另按协议和法律处理，不适用“一律不退”。本版条款尚未完成专业审定。</view><button class="primary gap" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="pay">{{view.mode === 'demo' ? '模拟支付 ¥900 并入营' : '申请创建支付订单（接入待完成）'}}</button></view>
  </block>
</view>
